{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I wake up to silence. The hum of the containment doors is gone. No alarms. No guards. Just flickering lights and the smell of ozone in the air. The last thing I remember is\u2026 running. Now the facility is wide open, and the anomalies are moving freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Somewhere in the dark, my partner\u2019s voice crackles through the comms. Together we\u2019ll have to restore systems, piece together what happened, and contain whatever escaped. Every corridor is a puzzle, every control panel another locked door between us and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We share scraps of information, sometimes by choice, sometimes because the system forces us to split up. I never know if my partner is telling me everything. Maybe they are saving themselves. Maybe I am.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The walls groan. The lights dim again. I hear footsteps that aren\u2019t mine. If we can solve the puzzles fast enough, we might keep the next breach from happening. If not\u2026 we\u2019ll be the next file in the archive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play  in tense  online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve layered environmental puzzles that demand communication and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the SCP Foundation facility from abandoned labs to locked research vaults</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a reactive story shaped by your actions, trust, and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter anomalies that adapt to your choices and the facility\u2019s systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and hidden truths to uncover across replays</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960460?t=1759743009","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960460?t=1759743009","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960460/95c20f3ae910194208818056e6d71699a447ba6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759743009","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960460/95c20f3ae910194208818056e6d71699a447ba6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759743009","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I wake up to silence. The hum of the containment doors is gone. No alarms. No guards. Just flickering lights and the smell of ozone in the air. The last thing I remember is\u2026 running. Now the facility is wide open, and the anomalies are moving freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Somewhere in the dark, my partner\u2019s voice crackles through the comms. Together we\u2019ll have to restore systems, piece together what happened, and contain whatever escaped. Every corridor is a puzzle, every control panel another locked door between us and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We share scraps of information, sometimes by choice, sometimes because the system forces us to split up. I never know if my partner is telling me everything. Maybe they are saving themselves. Maybe I am.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The walls groan. The lights dim again. I hear footsteps that aren\u2019t mine. If we can solve the puzzles fast enough, we might keep the next breach from happening. If not\u2026 we\u2019ll be the next file in the archive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play  in tense  online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve layered environmental puzzles that demand communication and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the SCP Foundation facility from abandoned labs to locked research vaults</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a reactive story shaped by your actions, trust, and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter anomalies that adapt to your choices and the facility\u2019s systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and hidden truths to uncover across replays</p></li></ul>","developers":["Wallangrad Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960460/b73b1c5601cfec7fcc51434e75de8a346999b84a/header.jpg?t=1759743009","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"SCP: Hellfire","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating syste